{% comment %}
  =============================================================================
  MAIN FAQ SECTION
  =============================================================================
  Primary FAQ (Frequently Asked Questions) page section with search functionality
  - Displays page title and content with configurable visibility
  - Optional FAQ search bar with real-time filtering
  - Sidebar integration for expandable content sections
  - Configurable text alignment and layout options
  - Integrates with page content and search functionality
  - Supports accessibility features and responsive design
{% endcomment %}

{% comment %}
  =============================================================================
  MAIN FAQ CONTAINER
  =============================================================================
  Primary container with section identification and sidebar configuration
  - central content: Consistent content layout and styling
  - py-medium: Medium vertical padding for proper spacing
  - data-section-type="faq": Identifies section type for JavaScript
  - data-sidebar-enabled: Boolean flag for sidebar visibility
  - data-sidebar-title: Custom sidebar title for expandable content
  - Provides foundation for FAQ content and sidebar integration
{% endcomment %}
<div class="central content py-medium" data-section-type="faq" data-sidebar-enabled="{{ section.settings.show_sidebar }}" data-sidebar-title="{{ section.settings.sidebar_title | escape }}">
  
  {% comment %}
    =============================================================================
    CONDITIONAL PAGE TITLE DISPLAY
    =============================================================================
    Optional page title with configurable alignment and animation
    - section.settings.show_title: Toggle for title visibility
    - h1: Semantic heading level for main page title
    - feature-header: Consistent heading styling across theme
    - align-{{ section.settings.text_alignment }}: Dynamic text alignment
    - page.title: Current page title from Shopify
    - data-cc-animate: JavaScript animation trigger for entrance effects
    - Only displays when show_title setting is enabled
  {% endcomment %}
  {% if section.settings.show_title %}<h1 class="feature-header align-{{ section.settings.text_alignment }}" data-cc-animate>{{ page.title }}</h1>{% endif %}

  {% comment %}
    =============================================================================
    CONDITIONAL PAGE CONTENT DISPLAY
    =============================================================================
    Optional page content with rich text formatting and alignment
    - section.settings.show_content: Toggle for content visibility
    - rte: Rich text editor styling for consistent typography
    - align-{{ section.settings.text_alignment }}: Dynamic text alignment
    - page.content: Rich text content from Shopify page editor
    - data-cc-animate: JavaScript animation trigger for entrance effects
    - Only displays when show_content setting is enabled
  {% endcomment %}
  {% if section.settings.show_content %}
    <div class="rte align-{{ section.settings.text_alignment }}" data-cc-animate>
      {{ page.content }}
    </div>
  {% endif %}

  {% comment %}
    =============================================================================
    FAQ SEARCH FUNCTIONALITY
    =============================================================================
    Optional search bar for filtering FAQ content
    - section.settings.show_search: Toggle for search functionality
    - inline-mini-form: Compact form styling for search input
    - inline-mini-form--arrow: Arrow button styling variant
    - mt-0: No top margin for proper spacing
    - data-cc-animate: JavaScript animation trigger for entrance effects
    - Provides real-time search filtering for FAQ content
  {% endcomment %}
  {% if section.settings.show_search %}
    {% comment %}
      =============================================================================
      SEARCH INPUT FORM
      =============================================================================
      Search input field with submit button and accessibility features
      - inline-mini-form: Compact form layout styling
      - inline-mini-form--arrow: Arrow button styling variant
      - faq-search__input: Unique identifier for search input
      - placeholder: Localized placeholder text for search input
      - search.terms: Pre-populated search terms from URL
      - aria-label: Accessible label for screen readers
      - autocomplete="off": Disables browser autocomplete
    {% endcomment %}
    <div class="inline-mini-form inline-mini-form--arrow mt-0" data-cc-animate>
      <input type="text"
       id="faq-search__input"
       placeholder="{{ 'faq.search.placeholder' | t }}"
       value="{{ search.terms | escape }}"
       aria-label="{{ 'faq.search.label' | t | escape }}"
       autocomplete="off" />
      
      {% comment %}
        =============================================================================
        SEARCH SUBMIT BUTTON
        =============================================================================
        Search button with icon and accessibility features
        - compact no-hover: Button styling classes
        - type="submit": Form submission button
        - aria-label: Accessible label for screen readers
        - general.search.search_button: Localized button text
        - svg-search: Search icon with customizable stroke width
        - stroke_width: 2.5: Icon stroke width for visual consistency
      {% endcomment %}
      <button class="compact no-hover" type="submit" aria-label="{{ 'general.search.search_button' | t | escape }}"
      >{% render 'svg-search', stroke_width: 2.5 %}</button>
    </div>

    {% comment %}
      =============================================================================
      NO SEARCH RESULTS MESSAGE
      =============================================================================
      Message displayed when search returns no results
      - faq-search__no_results: Styling class for no results message
      - faq.search.no_results: Localized message text
      - Provides user feedback when search yields no matches
    {% endcomment %}
    <div class="faq-search__no_results">
      {{ 'faq.search.no_results' | t }}
    </div>
  {% endif %}
</div>

{% comment %}
  =============================================================================
  SCHEMA CONFIGURATION SUMMARY
  =============================================================================
  Theme editor configuration for the main FAQ section
  
  **SECTION OVERVIEW:**
  Primary FAQ page section with configurable content display, search functionality,
  and sidebar integration for expandable content sections.
  
  **KEY FEATURES:**
  - Configurable page title and content display
  - Optional FAQ search functionality with real-time filtering
  - Sidebar integration for expandable content sections
  - Customizable text alignment and layout options
  - Accessibility features and responsive design
  
  **SECTION SETTINGS:**
  - show_title: Toggle page title visibility (default: true)
  - show_content: Toggle page content visibility (default: true)
  - text_alignment: Text alignment options (left/center, default: left)
  - show_search: Toggle FAQ search functionality (default: true)
  - show_sidebar: Toggle sidebar for expandable content (default: true)
  - sidebar_title: Custom title for sidebar display
  
  **CONTENT DISPLAY OPTIONS:**
  - Page title: H1 heading with configurable alignment
  - Page content: Rich text content with consistent styling
  - Search bar: Real-time FAQ content filtering
  - Sidebar: Integration with expandable content sections
  
  **SEARCH FUNCTIONALITY:**
  - Real-time content filtering
  - Pre-populated search terms from URL
  - Accessible input and button labels
  - No results message for user feedback
  
  **SIDEBAR INTEGRATION:**
  - Shows sidebar for consecutive expandable content sections
  - Customizable sidebar title
  - Integrates with expandable content blocks below
  - Provides navigation and context for FAQ content
  
  **ACCESSIBILITY FEATURES:**
  - Semantic HTML structure with proper headings
  - ARIA labels for search functionality
  - Screen reader friendly content structure
  - Keyboard accessible form elements
  
  **RESPONSIVE BEHAVIOR:**
  - Mobile-optimized layout and spacing
  - Consistent content styling across devices
  - Adaptive text alignment options
  - Touch-friendly search interface
{% endcomment %}
{% schema %}
{
  "name": "FAQ",
  "class": "section-faq",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "show_title",
      "label": "Show page title",
      "default": true
    },
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "show_content",
      "label": "Show page content",
      "default": true
    },
    {
      "type": "select",
      "id": "text_alignment",
      "label": "Text alignment",
      "options": [
        {
          "value": "left",
          "label": "Left"
        },
        {
          "value": "center",
          "label": "Center"
        }
      ],
      "default": "left"
    },
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "show_search",
      "label": "Show FAQ search bar",
      "default": true
    },
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "show_sidebar",
      "label": "Show FAQ sidebar",
      "info": "Shows a sidebar next to all consecutive 'Expandable content' sections immediately below this section.",
      "default": true
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "sidebar_title",
      "label": "Sidebar title"
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
